# Cybersecurity Threats Analysis (2015–2024)

**Author**: [Kailyn Philpot]  
**Course**: [Intro. to Data Science]  
**Project Description**:  
This project analyzes global cybersecurity incidents from 2015–2024 using Python in Jupyter Notebook. It includes data cleaning, exploratory analysis, visualizations, and insights on attack types, industries, financial impact, and resolution patterns.

**Contents**:
- `cybersecurity_analysis.ipynb` – Full notebook
- `cleaned_cybersecurity_data.csv` – Cleaned dataset
- `cybersecurity_analysis.html` – Exported HTML report
- `presentation_slides.pptx` – PowerPoint for class presentation

